    "posts": [
      {
        "id": 705066,
        "name": "Shreya Thakur",
        "username": "Shreyathakur",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discourse.onlinedegree.iitm.ac.in/shreyathakur/{size}/119734_2.png",
        "created_at": "2025-12-02T13:25:32.465Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I am writing to request a rescheduling of my <strong>System Commands (SC) OPPE</strong>, which has been allocated on <strong>December 6, 2025</strong> (OPPE2 Day 1). Unfortunately, I will be <strong>travelling on December 6 and 7, 2025</strong>, and during this time I will be on a train. Because of this, I will not be able to sit in a <strong>closed, proctored environment</strong>, and the <strong>internet connection will be unstable and fluctuating</strong>, making it impossible for me to take the exam smoothly.</p>\n<p>Considering this constraint, I kindly request whether it would be possible to <strong>reschedule my SC OPPE to OPPE Day 3 – December 13, 2025</strong>, as listed in the official schedule.</p>\n<p>Please let me know if this change can be arranged, or if there is someone specific I should contact for this request. I will be happy to provide any additional details if required.</p>\n<p>Thank you very much for your understanding and support.</p>\n<p>Warm regards,<br>\n<strong>Shreya Thakur</strong></p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "posts_count": 2,
