        "created_at": "2025-12-02T14:36:52.259Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hi <a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/shreyathakur\">@Shreyathakur</a></p>\n<p>Please inform the support team at <code>support@study.iitm.ac.in</code> with required documents as proof.<br>\nOn a side note, the second OPPE will be more difficult than first one.</p>\n<p>All the best.</p>\n<p>Thank you,<br>\nSwati Jain</p>",
